<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lānārĭus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to wool, wool-</i>
			(post-Aug.; cf.: lanifer, laniger, lamificus, lanatus).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herba,</span>”
				<i>fuller's-weed, soapwort</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					24, 18, 105, § 169</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 35</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Substt.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lānārĭus</span></b> ,
			ii, m., <i>a worker in
			wool</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Aul. 3, 5, 34</span></i>; cf.
					<i><span class="en">Arn. 2, 70</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Firm. Math. 8, 19: ‡ lanarius
					coactiliarius,</span>”
				<i>a maker of fulled stuffs, a fuller</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 4206</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">‡ lanarius pectinarius,</span>”
				<i>a woolcarder</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 4207</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			‡ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lānārĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i>a wool-factory,
				wool-spinning establishment</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr.
				Orell. 3303</span></i>. </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
